stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> PENDING : Finding received

    PENDING --> VALIDATING : Execute() called

    VALIDATING --> TIER_GATE : Fields valid
    VALIDATING --> [*] : nil / missing fields — error returned

    TIER_GATE --> DRY_RUN : dryRun=true
    TIER_GATE --> T1_EXECUTE : Tier 1 — auto-safe (always runs)
    TIER_GATE --> T2_EXECUTE : Tier 2 — AutoRemediationReady=true
    TIER_GATE --> SKIPPED : Tier 2/3 — AutoRemediationReady=false
    TIER_GATE --> SKIPPED : Tier 3 — change window required

    DRY_RUN --> [*] : DryRunResult returned (no state change)

    T1_EXECUTE --> VALIDATING_RESULT : handler.Remediate()
    T2_EXECUTE --> VALIDATING_RESULT : handler.Remediate()

    VALIDATING_RESULT --> COMPLETED : handler.Validate() — IsCompliant=true
    VALIDATING_RESULT --> FAILED : handler.Validate() — IsCompliant=false
    VALIDATING_RESULT --> FAILED : handler error

    COMPLETED --> ROLLBACK_ELIGIBLE : within 48h window
    ROLLBACK_ELIGIBLE --> ROLLED_BACK : registered rollback path executed
    ROLLED_BACK --> [*]

    SKIPPED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]

    note right of TIER_GATE
        T1: always auto-safe
        T2: needs AutoRemediationReady=true
        T3: manual approval + change window
    end note

    note right of COMPLETED
        RollbackState captured pre-remediation
        Registered handlers support rollback
        Window expires after 48h
    end note
